"Opens the app straight to the settings menu. Useful if you changed anything there and need to change it back but the app won't start." = "直接將 App 打開至設定選單。如果你在那裡更改了某些設定且需要改回來，但 App 無法啟動時很有用。";
"Recovery Mode" = "復原模式";
